      "statement": "Playback tracking starts once per song: sync emits PlaybackStart only when the snapshot is playing with a resolved song whose id differs from trackedSongId (steady-state snapshots do not restart tracking), PlayerControllerStateFacade feeds it to the duration tracker with the snapshot position as initialPlayedMs so pre-kill listening counts toward the 90% completion threshold, and handleMediaItemEnded clears trackedSongId so the next song starts a fresh tracking session.",
