    {
      "id": "claim_25cbf974762946fa87a7cd22c86abdda",
      "statement": "ControllerPlaybackStateSynchronizer.isPlayingTransition decides tracking transitions: shouldPauseTracking is true only for a non-buffering transition from playing to not-playing (which also triggers a playback-state save), shouldResumeTracking only for a start with a current song; buffering flips neither pause tracking nor persist a pause.",
