      "statement": "Progress rendering is driven solely by the positionMs narrow flow that PlayerPlaybackProgressTicker writes on a timer (200ms default since 2026-09-03, replacing 500ms to cut lyric-highlight latency), reading the Media3 local extrapolated position directly; applyControllerPlaybackState deliberately preserves PlayerUiState.currentPositionMs so snapshot sync neither advances the displayed position nor recomposes the shell, and NarrowFlowSync propagates only discrete position changes into the narrow flow using the pre-update uiState baseline.",
