      "statement": "A startup controller-unavailable failure also releases the restore handshake: PlayerRuntime.handleControllerUnavailable calls persistenceGraph.onControllerReady so pendingRestore cannot hang and the UI queue still restores; mid-playback invocations are side-effect-free because pendingRestore was already consumed.",
