    {
      "id": "claim_3274619d16d047258c91fddc41d84843",
      "statement": "PlaybackStateStore persists five DataStore keys (play_queue_json, play_position_ms, is_infinite_play, infinite_played_ids, current_song_id) with legacy SharedPreferences as a read fallback that is cleared after the next successful save; PlaybackStateSnapshotSerializer encodes songIds/currentIndex/playMode/playOrderIds by occurrence, restore filters songs to the current library (allowEmpty only for infinite play or a recorded currentSongId) and corrects currentIndex from currentSongId (single-song queue fallback), and saveCurrentPlaybackSnapshot overwrites only current_song_id and play_position_ms while preserving the queue JSON.",
