      "statement": "PlaybackController translates track changes into onMediaItemEnded for AUTO/SEEK/REPEAT media item transitions (PLAYLIST_CHANGED excluded), detecting window-tail wraps by index (isMediaItemWrap) because Media3 reports wrap-around navigation as SEEK and the REPEAT reason only means single-item repeat; a single-item REPEAT_MODE_ALL loop that never fires onMediaItemTransition is instead detected as an AUTO position discontinuity with a position rewind (isSingleItemLoopRewind); STATE_ENDED triggers onPlaybackEnded.",
